{"abstract":"OBJECTIVE: To describe the natural history of inhibin B throughout life according to sex, age, and pubertal development. METHODS: Based on serum samples from 2707 healthy controls aged 0 to 80 years, sex- and age-specific reference ranges of inhibin B concentrations were constructed. Concentrations were evaluated according to pubertal development and use of oral contraceptives (OCs). Also, measurements from 42 patients with Klinefelter syndrome were included. RESULTS: In both sexes, inhibin B concentrations were high during minipuberty, decreased in childhood, and increased significantly from Tanner stages B1 to B3 (peak: B4) in females and from G1 to G3 (peak: G3) in males. Despite variations in menstruating females, inhibin B concentrations remained relatively constant after puberty, until becoming unmeasurable at menopause. Despite a modest decrease, the inhibin B concentration in males remained relatively high from puberty onwards. At any age, males had highest concentrations. Inhibin B standard deviation (SD) scores were lower in OC-users (median SD score = -0.88) than in non-users (SD score = 0.35), p < 0.001. In patients with Klinefelter syndrome, inhibin B concentrations spanned the reference range until around 15 years of age, where they decreased to subnormal or unmeasurable levels. CONCLUSION: Valuable sex- and age-specific reference data for inhibin B concentrations were provided. In OC-users, decreased concentrations of inhibin B underlined the ovaries as the only place of inhibin B production. In patients with Klinefelter syndrome, the decline in inhibin B concentrations at puberty underlined the shift in regulation of inhibin B production at pubertal onset.","author_count":15,"contributors":["Borelli-Kjær, Anna","Aksglaede, Lise","Jensen, Rikke Beck","Hagen, Casper Petri","Ljubicic, Marie Lindhardt","Busch, Alexander Siegfried","Upners, Emmie Nicolina","Fischer, Margit Bistrup","Jensen, Tina Kold","Linneberg, Allan","Kårhus, Line Lund","Andersson, Anna-Maria","Petersen, Jørgen Holm","Juul, Anders","Johannsen, Trine Holm"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-790415"],"filters":{"added":"2025-02","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"serum concentrations of inhibin b in healthy females and males throughout life","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-790415","identifier":[{"id":"38920271","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85213139686","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-6867baa7-7041-42e6-bee0-3b63fdf7cc20"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-4113799414474C7BC4DA47AF3E25C5CF"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Rigshospitalet"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Internal Medicine: Geriatrics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Anna","key":"borellikjærannapau","last":"Borelli-Kjær","name":"Borelli-Kjær, Anna","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Lise","key":"aksglaedelisepau","last":"Aksglaede","name":"Aksglaede, Lise","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Rikke Beck","key":"jensenrikkebeckpau","last":"Jensen","name":"Jensen, Rikke Beck","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Casper Petri","key":"hagencasperpetripau","last":"Hagen","name":"Hagen, Casper Petri","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Marie Lindhardt","key":"ljubicicmarielindhardtpau","last":"Ljubicic","name":"Ljubicic, Marie Lindhardt","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Alexander Siegfried","key":"buschalexandersiegfriedpau","last":"Busch","name":"Busch, Alexander Siegfried","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Emmie Nicolina","key":"upnersemmienicolinapau","last":"Upners","name":"Upners, Emmie Nicolina","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Margit Bistrup","key":"fischermargitbistruppau","last":"Fischer","name":"Fischer, Margit Bistrup","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Tina Kold","key":"jensentinakoldpau","last":"Jensen","name":"Jensen, Tina Kold","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 1","first":"Allan","key":"linnebergallanpau","last":"Linneberg","locid":"09da8aa6-fd95-4ace-a2f1-19f38d7d3f9e","name":"Linneberg, Allan","orcid":"0000-0002-0994-0184","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Line Lund","key":"kårhuslinelundpau","last":"Kårhus","name":"Kårhus, Line Lund","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Anna-Maria","key":"anderssonannamariapau","last":"Andersson","name":"Andersson, Anna-Maria","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"Jørgen Holm","key":"petersenjørgenholmpau","last":"Petersen","locid":"33c1c5b2-2e1e-4259-b4d7-04657a2bdb9b","name":"Petersen, Jørgen Holm","orcid":"0000-0003-3979-7443","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"Anders","key":"juulanderspau","last":"Juul","locid":"f9b11983-c7c8-4111-b119-4de471572898","name":"Juul, Anders","orcid":"0000-0002-0534-4350","rank":14,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Trine Holm","key":"johannsentrineholmpau","last":"Johannsen","name":"Johannsen, Trine Holm","rank":15,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["38920271"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1210/clinem/dgae439","issn":["0021972X","19457197"],"issn_org":["0021972X"],"issue":"1","journal":"Journal of Clinical Endocrinology and Metabolism","pages":"70-77","status":"p","title":"Journal of Clinical Endocrinology and Metabolism","title_org":"The Journal of clinical endocrinology and metabolism","volume":"110"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85213139686"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-6867baa7-7041-42e6-bee0-3b63fdf7cc20"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Serum Concentrations of Inhibin B in Healthy Females and Males Throughout Life","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-790415","year":"2025","yearsub":"2025"}
{"abstract":"Global plastic production exceeded 400 million tons in 2022, urgently demanding improved waste management and recycling strategies for a circular plastic economy. While the enzymatic hydrolysis of polyethylene terephthalate (PET) has become feasible on industrial scales, efficient enzymes targeting other hydrolyzable plastic types, such as polyurethanes (PURs), are lacking. Recently, enzymes of the amidase signature (AS) family, capable of cleaving urethane bonds in a polyether-PUR analog and a linear polyester-PUR, have been identified. Herein, we present high-resolution crystal structures of the AS enzyme UMG-SP3 in three states: ligand-free, bound with a suicidal inhibitor mimicking the transition state, and bound with a monomeric PUR degradation product. Besides revealing the conserved core and catalytic triad akin to other AS family members, the UMG-SP3 structures show remarkable flexibility of loop regions. Particularly, Arg209 in loop 3 adopts two induced-fit conformations upon ligand binding. Through structure-guided kinetic studies and enzyme engineering, we mapped structural key elements that determine the enhanced hydrolysis of urethane and amide bonds in various small molecules, including a linear PUR fragment analog. Our findings contribute critical insights into urethanase activity, aiding PUR degradation campaigns and sustainable plastic recycling efforts in the future.","author_count":18,"contributors":["Rotilio, Laura","Bayer, Thomas","Meinert, Hannes","Teixeira, Luis M C","Johansen, Martin B","Sommerfeldt, Andreas","Petersen, Allan R","Sandahl, Alexander","Keller, Malene B","Holck, Jesper","Paiva, Pedro","Otzen, Daniel E","Bornscheuer, Uwe T","Wei, Ren","Fernandes, Pedro A","Ramos, Maria J","Westh, Peter","Morth, Jens Preben"],"cuid":["S02-099.82-793264"],"filters":{"added":"2025-01","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Morth, Jens Preben","Westh, Peter"],"country":["Germany","Portugal"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Greifswald","University of Porto"],"keyword":["Amidase","Crystal structure","Enzyme catalysis","Protein engineering","Thermoset plastic"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Embargoed Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-U"],"level3":{"GTS":["DI-GTS-ALL","DI-GTS-DTCI"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-GTS-DTCI","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"structural and functional characterization of an amidase targeting a polyurethane for sustainable recycling","src":["au","dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85212527398","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-099.82-793264","identifier":[{"id":"85212527398","type":"scopus"},{"id":"39611359","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-5aefebd5-f943-4995-abfc-42c042f8d65f","dtu-5bfe00ad-a0d4-4741-b381-787707359042"],"keyword":["amidase","crystal structure","enzyme catalysis","protein engineering","thermoset plastic"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-C8AD874F7AE5A1F5FFF62506CFFE2465"],"oa_link":[{"access":"ea","embargo":"2025-11-29","type":"loc","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Biotechnology and Biomedicine","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Biotechnology and Biomedicine, Section for Protein Chemistry and Enzyme Technology","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Biotechnology and Biomedicine, Section for Protein Chemistry and Enzyme Technology, Structural Enzymology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"de","key":"university of greifswald","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Greifswald","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"pt","key":"university of porto","loc":["Portugal","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Porto","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"dk","key":"danish technological institute","l2":"DI-GTS","l2n":"GTS Institutes","l3":"DI-GTS-DTCI","l3nn":"Danish Technological Institute","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Danish Technological Institute","namevar":["Danish Technological Institute"],"nora_code":"DI-GTS-DTCI","used":1},{"affno":"5","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Interdisciplinary Nanoscience Center"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Laura","key":"rotiliopau","last":"Rotilio","locid":"5302aebd-6243-4275-871b-ea4c5d002423","name":"Rotilio, Laura","orcid":"0000-0001-5260-6483","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas","key":"bayerpau","last":"Bayer","name":"Bayer, Thomas","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Hannes","key":"meinertpau","last":"Meinert","name":"Meinert, Hannes","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Luis M C","key":"teixeirapau","last":"Teixeira","name":"Teixeira, Luis M C","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Martin B","key":"johansenpau","last":"Johansen","name":"Johansen, Martin B","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Andreas","key":"sommerfeldtpau","last":"Sommerfeldt","name":"Sommerfeldt, Andreas","rank"