T":["Published"]},"sid":["au-4f9bdb24-1943-40ec-9207-75ed7f27b889"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"The risk of secondary progressive multiple sclerosis is geographically determined but modifiable","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-707638","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"Complement components have been linked to schizophrenia and autoimmune disorders. We examined the association between neonatal circulating C3 and C4 protein concentrations in 68,768 neonates and the risk of six mental disorders. We completed genome-wide association studies (GWASs) for C3 and C4 and applied the summary statistics in Mendelian randomization and phenome-wide association studies related to mental and autoimmune disorders. The GWASs for C3 and C4 protein concentrations identified 15 and 36 independent loci, respectively. We found no associations between neonatal C3 and C4 concentrations and mental disorders in the total sample (both sexes combined); however, post-hoc analyses found that a higher C3 concentration was associated with a reduced risk of schizophrenia in females. Mendelian randomization based on C4 summary statistics found an altered risk of five types of autoimmune disorders. Our study adds to our understanding of the associations between C3 and C4 concentrations and subsequent mental and autoimmune disorders.","author_count":24,"contributors":["Borbye-Lorenzen, Nis","Zhu, Zhihong","Agerbo, Esben","Albiñana, Clara","Benros, Michael Eriksen","Bian, Beilei","Børglum, Anders D.","Bulik, Cynthia M.","Debost, Jean-Christophe Philippe Goldtsche","Grove, Jakob","Hougaard, David M.","McRae, Allan F.","Mors, Ole","Mortensen, Preben Bo","Musliner, Katherine L.","Nordentoft, Merete","Petersen, Liselotte V.","Privé, Florian","Sidorenko, Julia","Skogstrand, Kristin","Werge, Thomas","Wray, Naomi R.","Vilhjálmsson, Bjarni J.","McGrath, John J."],"cuid":["S02-100.00-724707"],"filters":{"added":"2024-02","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["America, North","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD","Oceania"],"country":["Australia","Sweden","United Kingdom","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Karolinska Institutet","Queensland Centre for Mental Health Research","University of North Carolina","University of North Carolina at Chapel Hill","University of Oxford","University of Queensland"],"keyword":["Autoimmune disorders","C3","Dried blood spots","Genome Wide Association Study","Mendelian randomization","Phenome wide association study","Psychiatric disorders","Schizophrenia"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-HO","DI-NP","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-SSI"],"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CDR"],"NP":["DI-NP-ALL","DI-NP-LUND"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-SSI","DI-HO-CDR","DI-NP-LUND","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the correlates of neonatal complement component 000000000003 and 000000000004 protein concentrations with a focus on psychiatric and autoimmune disorders","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.xgen.2023.100457","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-724707","identifier":[{"id":"38116117","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85179497801","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC10726496","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["au-7aa3292a-a1a8-4780-bbe1-cc4eb7867193","ku-461b035d-e3fa-4c7b-98e3-e718bf5a57d4"],"keyword":["C3","C4","Mendelian randomization","autoimmune disorders","complement component","dried blood spots","genome-wide association study","phenome-wide association study","psychiatric disorders","schizophrenia"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science","Social Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-8BC3B90F05FC33B29F91FE2ACA587BB1"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/378195443/1_s2.0_S2666979X23003014_main.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/371270857/1-s2.0-S2666979X23003014-