en, Lars","orcid":"0000-0003-0892-1579","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Allan","key":"stensballepau","last":"Stensballe","locid":"31ce2dbc-d5bc-4266-8c26-1b38838c7346","name":"Stensballe, Allan","orcid":"0000-0002-9888-1955","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-46c80c38-8ce3-4035-a74b-0bce8ae150be"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Global proteomics profiling of serum and synovial fluid identifies biomarkers associated with improved PainDetect scores after intraarticular gold for management of painful knee osteoarthritis","type":"Conference Poster","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-725663","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"A major challenge of genome-wide association studies (GWASs) is to translate phenotypic associations into biological insights. Here, we integrate a large GWAS on blood lipids involving 1.6 million individuals from five ancestries with a wide array of functional genomic datasets to discover regulatory mechanisms underlying lipid associations. We first prioritize lipid-associated genes with expression quantitative trait locus (eQTL) colocalizations and then add chromatin interaction data to narrow the search for functional genes. Polygenic enrichment analysis across 697 annotations from a host of tissues and cell types confirms the central role of the liver in lipid levels and highlights the selective enrichment of adipose-specific chromatin marks in high-density lipoprotein cholesterol and triglycerides. Overlapping transcription factor (TF) binding sites with lipid-associated loci identifies TFs relevant in lipid biology. In addition, we present an integrative framework to prioritize causal variants at GWAS loci, producing a comprehensive list of candidate causal genes and variants with multiple layers of functional evidence. We highlight two of the prioritized genes, CREBRF and RRBP1, which show convergent evidence across functional datasets supporting their roles in lipid biology.","author_count":69,"contributors":["Ramdas, Shweta","Judd, Jonathan","Graham, Sarah E.","Kanoni, Stavroula","Wang, Yuxuan","Surakka, Ida","Wenz, Brandon","Clarke, Shoa L.","Chesi, Alessandra","Wells, Andrew","Bhatti, Konain Fatima","Vedantam, Sailaja","Winkler, Thomas W.","Locke, Adam E.","Marouli, Eirini","Zajac, Greg J.M.","Wu, Kuan Han H.","Ntalla, Ioanna","Hui, Qin","Klarin, Derek","Hilliard, Austin T.","Wang, Zeyuan","Xue, Chao","Thorleifsson, Gudmar","Helgadottir, Anna","Gudbjartsson, Daniel F.","Holm, Hilma","Olafsson, Isleifur","Hwang, Mi Yeong","Han, Sohee","Zhao, Jing Hua","Aadahl, Mette","Bork-Jensen, Jette","Møllehave, Line T.","Liu, Jun","Wang, Jun-Sing","Vestergaard, Henrik","Jackson, Rebecca D","Kovacs, Peter","Pedersen, Oluf","Hansen, Torben","Lind, Lars","Loos, Ruth J.F.","Christensen, Kaare","Linneberg, Allan","Grarup, Niels","Dantoft, Thomas M.","Karpe, Fredrik","Wei, Wei Qi","Sun, Yan V."],"cuid":["S02-092.23-047671"],"filters":{"added":"2022-09","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"51-200 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["America, North","Asia, East","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"corpau":["Global Lipids Genetics Consortium","Million Veterans Program"],"corresponding_author":["Brown, Christopher D."],"country":["Finland","Germany","Iceland","Japan","Norway","South Korea","United Kingdom","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Atlanta Veterans Affairs Medical Center","Boston Children's Hospital","Boston University","Boston University School of Public Health","Broad Institute","Cincinnati Children's Hospital Medical Center","Department of Veterans Affairs","Emory University","Harvard University","Institut für Zoologie der Universität","Korea National Institute of Health","Landspitali University Hospital","Mayo Clinic","National Institute of Health","Northwestern University Feinberg School of Medicine","Norwegian University of Science and Technology","Osaka University","Palo Alto Veterans Affairs Health Care System","Queen Mary University of London","RIKEN Center for Sustainable Resource Science","Rollins School of Public Health","Stanford University","The National University Hospital of Iceland","University of Cambridge","University of Florida","University of Helsinki","University of Iceland","University of Michigan","University of Michigan, Ann Arbor","University of Pennsylvania","University of Regensburg","University of St Andrews","University of Washington","VA Medical Center","Vanderbilt University Medical Center","Washington University St. Louis","deCODE Genetics"],"keyword":["Complex traits","Functional genomics","Post GWAS","Regulatory mechanism","Variant prioritization","fine mapping","lipid biology"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a multi layer functional genomic analysis to understand noncoding genetic variation in lipids","src":["ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC9388392/pdf/main.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-092.23-047671","identifier":[{"id":"35931049","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC9388392","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"85135598739","type":"scopus"},{"id":"000850681500003","type":"wos"}],"ids":["ku-fd718a4e-f15b-48a0-9f66-65094fb8d1a3","sdu-3d7e5705-c396-4a68-aca9-29471e1f5090"],"keyword":["complex traits","fine-mapping","functional genomics","lipid biology","post-GWAS","regulatory mechanism","variant prioritization"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-C4945EB031D6CA6ECC2DB3626D883B84"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC9388392/pdf/main.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"us","key":"university of pennsylvania","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"University of Pennsylvania","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"stanford university","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Stanford University","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"us","key":"university of michigan ann arbor","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"University of Michigan, Ann Arbor","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"us","key":"univers