{"abstract":"The facile removal of the cyanide anion from cyanide-containing water was achieved by the use of CO 2 in conjunction with aldehydes which can be recycled from the process. The conversion of the cyanide ion to an insoluble cyanohydrin in water allowed for the removal of cyanide and could be used as a method of treating cyanide contaminated wastewater and of recovering cyanide or cyanohydrins for further applications.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Petersen, Allan R.","Juhl, Martin","Petrovic, Aleksa","Lee, Ji Woong"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-456756"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Aldehydes","Carbon dioxide fixation","Carbon storage","Cyanides","Waste prevention"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"co000000000002 mediated non destructive cyanide wastewater treatment","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/279649225/CO2_Mediated_Non_Destructive_Cyanide_Wastewater_Treatment_accepted_version_.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-456756","identifier":[{"id":"85115761795","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-6a032424-89cb-4fb7-b54d-c8f8c5db25cd"],"keyword":["Aldehydes","Carbon storage","Waste prevention","carbon dioxide fixation","cyanides"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-A21D916D62040BBAB3201986D53197F4"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/279649225/CO2_Mediated_Non_Destructive_Cyanide_Wastewater_Treatment_accepted_version_.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Chemistry, Department of Chemistry"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Allan R.","key":"petersenpau","last":"Petersen","locid":"d1db46ef-d4a8-44f6-82b3-23da5615625a","name":"Petersen, Allan R.","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Martin","key":"juhlpau","last":"Juhl","locid":"5a99742e-d2c4-47ec-807a-88cc52d3ff71","name":"Juhl, Martin","orcid":"0000-0001-5395-9627","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Aleksa","key":"petrovicpau","last":"Petrovic","locid":"dfc8d63e-b88a-4689-9b2c-10622b18ea0a","name":"Petrovic, Aleksa","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Ji-Woong","key":"leepau","last":"Lee","locid":"be232f36-45bb-4dda-9f45-f4885a4301e4","name":"Lee, Ji Woong","name_org":"Lee, Ji-Woong","orcid":"0000-0001-6177-4569","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1002/ejoc.202100997","issn":["10990690","1434193X"],"issn_org":["10990690"],"issue":"35","journal":"European Journal of Organic Chemistry","pages":"5003-5007","status":"p","title":"European Journal of Organic Chemistry","volume":"2001"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85115761795"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-6a032424-89cb-4fb7-b54d-c8f8c5db25cd"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"CO2-Mediated Non-Destructive Cyanide Wastewater Treatment","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-456756","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Congenital portosystemic shunts (CPSS) are rare malformations, which connect the portal venous system and the systemic circulation. The disorder is discovered at prenatal screening, neonatal cholestasis as an incidental finding or by systemic complications such as pulmonary hypertension, encephalopathies or liver nodules. CPSS are associated to cardiac malformations and several syndromes. Intervention radiology plays a key role in treatment by closure of the shunt, which is indicated, if the patient has complications, the shunt is extrahepatic, or it is still persistent at two years of age, using a two-step approach, as summarised and discussed in this review.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Tinning, Fie Brantbjerg","Petersen, Olav Bjørn","Steensberg, Jesper Normann","Buchvald, Frederik Fouirnaies","Fallentin, Eva","Rasmussen, Allan","Frevert, Susanne","Jørgensen, Marianne Hørby"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-531456"],"filters":{"added":"2023-02","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Child","Female","Heart Defects Congenital","Humans","Hypertension Pulmonary","Infant Newborn","Portal Vein diagnostic imaging","Portasystemic Shunt Transjugular Intrahepatic","Pregnancy","Vascular Malformations"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"kongenitte portosystemiske shunter diagnose og behandling af en multisystemisk sygdom hos børn","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/337307279/v01210041_web.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-531456","identifier":[{"id":"85113858065","type":"scopus"},{"id":"34378520","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-e7193c7a-e357-40a5-