{"abstract":"Patients with bone sarcoma report that quality of life (QoL) is affected years after treatment. In rehabilitation, both QoL and different measures of physical function are assessed and targeted. However, few studies have investigated physical function and its relationship to QoL in this patient group.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Fernandes, Linda","Zebis, Mette Kreutzfeldt","Skovlund Sørensen, Michala","Holm, Christina","Villadsen, Allan","Mørk Petersen, Michael"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-391377"],"filters":{"added":"2023-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["health nutrition and quality of life"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-UC"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-KEN"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-KP"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-KEN","DI-UC-KP"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"physical function is reduced and correlated to quality of life after limb sparing surgery due to bone sarcoma","src":["kp"],"src-code":["DI-UC-KP"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://ortopaedi.dk/abstractbog/2020/82/","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-391377","ids":["kp-c0952e96-8e86-4264-826d-b35c6678e1ad"],"keyword":["health, nutrition and quality of life"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-B70F4FABA5F98CB4D3079CBA1BD52986"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://ortopaedi.dk/abstractbog/2020/82/","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"kp university college copenhagen","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-KP","l3nl":"KP","l3nn":"KP University College Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KP University College Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Professionshøjskole, Rektors område, Fakultet for sundhedsuddannelser - Dekan, Fysioterapeutuddannel