cal function is reduced and correlated to quality of life after limb-sparing surgery due to bone sarcoma","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-391377","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"A total of 714 pediatric cases of Staphylococcus aureus bacteremia were identified from 2008 to 2015 in Denmark; 98% were methicillin-susceptible S. aureus (MSSA). Fifteen isolates (2,1%) were Panton-Valentine leucocidin positive (0.17/100,000 children/year) and 87% MSSA. Eight cases (53%) were severe, including all pneumonia cases. Panton-Valentine leucocidin positive Staphylococcus aureus bacteremia is rare in our setting with high MSSA-prevalence. Half of the cases were uncomplicated.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Bybeck Nielsen, Allan","Larsen, Anders Rhod","Petersen, Andreas","Schønheyder, Henrik Carl","Westh, Henrik","Benfield, Thomas","Nygaard, Ulrikka"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-007094"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Bacteremia","Staphylococcus aureus"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-SSI"],"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"OT":["From the Department of Pediatrics and Adolescent Medicine"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-SSI","DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"clinical manifestations in children with staphylococcal bacteremia positive for panton valentine leucocidin a nationwide survey in a low methicillin resistance setting","src":["aau","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85089618523&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-007094","identifier":[{"id":"32496412","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85089618523","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-922f29f8-2565-4137-b142-cc163f907cbc","ku-85a70fe6-db4c-4d47-aad3-79294409ae1d"],"keyword":["Panton-Valentine leucocidin","Staphylococcus aureus","bacteremia"],"lang":"En