{"abstract":"We plan to compare satisfaction with a standard website versus satisfaction with a participatory driven webapplication in a future randomised controlled trial (RCT). The web-application may facilitate the delivery of evidence-based advice and information to patients with low back pain (LBP) in general practice.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Hjelmager, Ditte Meulengracht","Vinther, Line Dausel","Poulsen, Søren Herold","Petersen, Lone Stub","Jensen, Martin Bach","Riis, Allan"],"cuid":["S02-095.95-004108"],"event":{"end":"2020-10-17","place":"Online meeting","start":"2020-10-16","title":"90th EGPRN MEETING Virtual Conference","year":"2020"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Physiotherapy"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-UC"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-UCN"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-UC-UCN"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"advice and information for patients with low back pain an interview study of general practitioners","src":["aau","ucn"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-UC-UCN"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S02-095.95-004108","ids":["aau-53f11907-d362-4435-aeb9-99313e8504f8","ucn-94921606-abcc-4927-8bd6-f742d6512c60"],"keyword":["physiotherapy"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-2-18FD41577A0C238AE60F9B18F928524D"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design","Aalborg University, The Technical Faculty of IT and Design, Department of Sustainability and Planning"],"nora_cod