{"abstract":"The authors involved in the creation of this text collaborate on a research project called The Culture of Grief, which explores the current conditions and implications of grief. The authors mostly employ conventional forms of qualitative inquiry, but the present text represents an attempt to reach a level of understanding not easily obtained through conventional methods. The group of authors participated as members of the audience in an avant-garde theatrical performance about grief, created by a group called CoreAct. The artists of CoreAct create their art through systematic research, in this case on grief, and we as researchers decided to study both the development of the play and its performance, and to report our impressions in fragments in a way that hopefully represents the nature of grief as an experienced phenomenon. We use Hans Ulrich Gumbrecht’s concept of presence to look for understanding beyond meaning in grief and its theatrical enactment.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Brinkmann, Svend","Brescó, Ignacio","Kofod, Ester Holte","Køster, Allan","Overvad, Anna Therese","Petersen, Anders","Suhr, Anne","Tateo, Luca","Wagoner, Brady","Winther-Lindqvist, Ditte"],"cuid":["S02-098.11-003760"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corresponding_author":["Brinkmann, Svend"],"keyword":["Ethnography","Forskningsmetode","Grief","Hermeneutics","Methodologies","Presence","arts based inquiry","ethnographies","methods of inquiry"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the presence of grief research based art and arts based research on grief","src":["aau","au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85050542130&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-098.11-003760","identifier":[{"id":"85050542130","type":"scopus"},{"id":"000486538800009","type":"wos"}],"ids":["aau-4cde26ce-cd6a-48d8-aae7-4a01dfad839b","au-e08a93e7-d0c8-4209-9904-8083604974ef"],"keyword":["Forskningsmetode","arts-based inquiry","ethnographies","ethnography","grief","hermeneutics","methodologies","methods of inquiry","presence"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-BD6462BA3B65F10D6F460D9EF124F76D"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Humanities (HUM)"],"yearPub":"2019","yearSub":"2019"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, Center for Kvalitative Studier","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, Centre for Cultural Psychology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, Qualitative Studies","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Communication and Psychology, The culture of grief"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, Danish School of Education, Danish School of Education - Department of 