{"abstract":"A vanadium‐catalysed deoxydehydration (DODH) of neat glycerol has been developed. Cheap and readily available ammonium metavanadate (NH4VO3) affords higher yields of allyl alcohol than the well‐established catalyst methyltrioxorhenium. A study in which deuterium‐labelled glycerol was used was undertaken to further elucidate the dual role of glycerol as both an oxidant and reductant. This study led to the proposal of a metal‐catalysed DODH mechanism for the production of allyl alcohol and a deeper understanding of the formation of the byproducts acrolein and propanal.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Petersen, Allan Robertson","Nielsen, Lasse Bo","Dethlefsen, Johannes Rytter","Fristrup, Peter"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-358334"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Petersen, Allan Robertson"],"keyword":["Alcohols","Isotopic labeling","Reaction mechanisms","Rhenium","Vanadium"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"vanadium catalyzed deoxydehydration of glycerol without an external reductant","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85042293561","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-358334","identifier":[{"id":"85042293561","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-b3f0d6e2-2f71-40a0-b039-775905a92818"],"keyword":["Alcohols","Isotopic labeling","Reaction mechanisms","Rhenium","Vanadium"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-F2A5DD947439AE0514974D92FC8D4214"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U"