{"abstract":"The kinetic energy that is released upon bond rupture is often represented as T1/2. A value that is derived from the FWHM of a fragment peak by the use of two different conversion formulas. The choice of formula depends on whether the peak is recorded by scanning a magnetic sector or an electrostatic analyzer. We have conducted a systematic variation of the possible scan configurations of two different double focusing instruments in two countries. We have found that a double focusing mass spectrometer in normal geometry gives rise to T1/2 values that are 1.4 times larger when analyzing peaks that are obtained from magnet scans compared to the peaks that are obtained by scanning an electrostatic analyzer. The E scans (MIKE experiments) give rise to the same values for both of the employed mass spectrometers. The results are explained in terms of energy defocusing when the reactions take place too far away from the focal points and show that only the E scans T1/2 values can be compared from instrument to instrument.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Petersen, Allan Christian","Sølling, Theis Ivan"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-507797"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Kinetic energy release"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"determination of kinetic energy release from metastable peak widths an investigation of the instrument dependence","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-507797","identifier":[{"id":"85018444786","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-bfa7ae18-dd24-40f2-9111-a03a8b6d6716"],"keyword":["Kinetic energy release","Sector mass spectrometry"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-564C5834704A7F7356F5D836CC565494"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Chemistry"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Allan Christian","key":"petersenpau","last":"Petersen","locid":"0fb5fb3f-47e3-45bd-9131-77c78e17ad9b","name":"Petersen, Allan Christian","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Theis Ivan","key":"søllingpau","last":"Sølling","locid":"5db24645-70db-461f-a061-dd6612993ec8","name":"Sølling, Theis Ivan","orcid":"0000-0003-1710-9072","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.ijms.2017.04.002","issn":["13873806","18732798"],"issn_org":["13873806"],"journal":"International Journal of Mass Spectrometry","pages":"14-17","status":"p","title":"International Journal of Mass Spectrometry","volume":"429"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85018444786"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-bfa7ae18-dd24-40f2-9111-a03a8b6d6716"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Determination of kinetic energy release from metastable peak widths : An investigation of the instrument-dependence","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-507797","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
