:"Maltesen","locid":"079f181f-c4c5-401e-8190-0da5c869f53b","name":"Maltesen, Thomas","name_org":"Maltesen, T.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"J. H.","key":"petersenpau","last":"Petersen","locid":"33c1c5b2-2e1e-4259-b4d7-04657a2bdb9b","name":"Petersen, Jørgen Holm","name_org":"Petersen, J. H.","orcid":"0000-0003-3979-7443","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"A.","key":"krasnikpau","last":"Krasnik","locid":"d1a42a6c-e3d6-4d5b-803e-e80b13314d46","name":"Krasnik, Allan","name_org":"Krasnik, A.","orcid":"0000-0003-1612-6129","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1093/eurpub/ckw174.244","issn":["11011262","1464360X"],"issn_org":["11011262"],"issue":"Supplemt 1","journal":"European Journal of Public Health","pages":"426-426","status":"p","title":"European Journal of Public Health","volume":"26"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-5b968d64-574c-449e-9648-0bbc5c11afba"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Effect of Healthcare system information on immigrants' knowledge of the healthcare system","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-448256","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"Background: Cellular T-helper (Th)17 infiltrates dominate skin inflammation in filaggrin-deficient flaky tail (ft/ft) mice, and Th17 cells are found in both the skin and blood of patients with acute atopic dermatitis. However, the potential role of loss-of-function mutations in the filaggrin gene (FLG) for increased peripheral Th17 cells is unclear. Objectives: To study whether mutations in FLG influence the frequency of peripheral Th17 cells. Methods: We studied blood samples from six adults with mutations in FLG and five controls without mutations for frequencies of cytokine-producing CD4+ T cells. We evaluated ft/ft mice and wild-type (WT) control mice for interleukin (IL)-17-producing CD4+ T cells in naive mice and following 2,4-dinitrofluorobenzene (DNFB) challenge. In addition, the T-cell receptor (TCR) Vβ-chain repertoire was analysed by flow cytometry. Results: Human studies showed increased frequency of peripheral Th17 cells in FLG mutation carriers when compared with WT individuals. Mouse studies showed increased frequency of peripheral Th17 cells in adult ft/ft mice but not in 2-week-old ft/ft mice. Moreover, altered TCR Vβ-chain repertoire was found in ft/ft mice when compared with WT mice. An increased frequency of CD4+ Vβ10+ T cells producing IL-17 was found in the spleen of adult ft/ft mice when compared with WT mice. Finally, DNFB challenge induced an increased number of Th17 cells in ft/ft mice compared with WT mice. Conclusions: Deficiency of filaggrin appeared to be a driver of increased peripheral levels of Th17 cells. This increase must be acquired as peripheral Th17 cells were found in adult ft/ft mice but not in 2-week-old ft/ft mice indicating involvement of exogenous factors.","author_count":11,"contributors":["Bonefeld, Charlotte Menné","Petersen, Trine Hilkjær","Bandier, J.","Agerbeck, Christina","Linneberg, Allan","Ross-Hansen, K.","Stender, S.","Szecsi, P. B.","Johansen, Jeanne D","Geisler, Carsten","Thyssen, Jacob P."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-454120"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"epidermal filaggrin deficiency mediates increased systemic t helper 000000000017 immune response","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-454120","identifier":[{"id":"84990197993","type":"scopus"},{"id":"26997324","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-6592e117-be31-44c2-a8b7-250f506443e8"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-802230006E8B9CCA1261AB24D045F2A9"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Immunology and Microbiology, Department of Immunology and Microbiology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Rigshospitalet"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"C. M.","key":"bonefeldpau","last":"Bonefeld","locid":"984200fd-eadd-4a8b-a9f0-92d4158657a8","name":"Bonefeld, Charlotte Menné","name_org":"Bonefeld, C. M.","orcid":"0000-0002-0523-6229","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"