,"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-6592e117-be31-44c2-a8b7-250f506443e8"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Epidermal filaggrin deficiency mediates increased systemic T-helper 17 immune response","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-454120","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
