{"abstract":"The molybdate-catalysed transfer hydrodeoxygenation (HDO) of benzyl alcohol to toluene driven by oxidation of the solvent isopropyl alcohol to acetone has been investigated by using a combination of experimental and computational methods. A Hammett study that compared the relative rates for the transfer HDO of five para-substituted benzylic alcohols was carried out. Density-functional theory (DFT) calculations suggest a transition state with significant loss of aromaticity contributes to the lack of linearity observed in the Hammett study. The transfer HDO could also be carried out in neat PhCH2OH at 175°C. Under these conditions, PhCH2OH underwent disproportionation to yield benzaldehyde, toluene, and significant amounts of bibenzyl. Isotopic-labelling experiments (using PhCH2OD and PhCD2OH) showed that incorporation of deuterium into the resultant toluene originated from the αposition of benzyl alcohol, which is in line with the mechanism suggested by the DFT study.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Larsen, Daniel Bo","Petersen, Allan Robertson","Dethlefsen, Johannes Rytter","Gorfo, Ayele Teshome","Fristrup, Peter"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-307888"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Density functional calculations","Deoxygenation","Homogeneous catalysis","Molybdenum"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"mechanistic investigation of molybdate catalysed transfer hydrodeoxygenation","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84990889306","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-307888","identifier":[{"id":"84990889306","type":"scopus"},{"id":"27723128","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["dtu-0af0ce3a-28c2-4360-9ef6-3330581cba06"],"keyword":["Density functional calculations","Deoxygenation","Hammett","Homogeneous catalysis","Molybdenum"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-E9BC039DD1F148C19808EA418E759FB9"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Chemistry","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Chemistry, Organic Chemistry"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Daniel Bo","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"f1187c87-4ff6-4362-9300-02aae518112e","name":"Larsen, Daniel Bo","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Allan Robertson","key":"petersenpau","last":"Petersen","locid":"c969de0c-e6f8-430e-a35d-e5ab65961b69","name":"Petersen, Allan Robertson","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Johannes Rytter","key":"dethlefsenpau","last":"Dethlefsen","locid":"dc10ba92-3fe8-4a88-ad3d-1f80c9b0c6b5","name":"Dethlefsen, Johannes Rytter","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Ayele Teshome","key":"gorfopau","last":"Gorfo","locid":"772e75fc-fd9a-4cde-8028-366d70b859c8","name":"Gorfo, Ayele Teshome","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Peter","key":"fristruppau","last":"Fristrup","locid":"8d08da7d-df58-43c3-abc0-916a441741c1","name":"Fristrup, Peter","orcid":"0000-0001-7175-3796","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["27723128"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1002/chem.201603028","issn":["09476539","15213765"],"issn_org":["09476539"],"issue":"46","journal":"Chemistry - A European Journal","pages":"16621-16631","publisher":"John Wiley and Sons Inc.","status":"p","title":"Chemistry - A European Journal","volume":"22"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84990889306"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-0af0ce3a-28c2-4360-9ef6-3330581cba06"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Mechanistic Investigation of Molybdate-Catalysed Transfer Hydrodeoxygenation","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-307888","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"Loads from extreme waves can be dimensioning for the substructures of offshore wind turbines. The DeRisk project (2015-2019) aims at an improved load evaluation procedure for extreme waves through application of advanced wave models, laboratory tests of load effects, development of hydrodynamic load models, aero-elastic response calculations and statistical analysis. This first paper from the project outlines the content and philosophy behind DeRisk. Next, the first results from laboratory tests with irregular waves are presented, including results for 2D and 3D focused wave groups. The results of focused wave group tests and a 6-hour (full scale duration) test are reproduced numerically by re-application of the wave paddle signal in a fully nonlinear potential flow wave model. A good match for the free surface elevation and associated exceedance probability curve is obtained. Finally, the utilization of DeRisk's results in practical design is discussed. (C) 2016 Published by Elsevier Ltd.","author_count":25,"contributors":["Bredmose, Henrik","Dixen, Martin","Ghadirian, Amin","Larsen, Torben J.","Schløer, Signe","Andersen, Søren Juhl","Wang, Shaofeng","Bingham, Harry B.","Lindberg, Ole","Christensen, Erik Damgaard","Vested, Malene Hovgaard","Carstensen, Stefan","Engsig-Karup, Allan Peter","Petersen, Ole Skov","Hansen, H. F.","Mariegaard, Jesper Sandvig","Taylor, P. H.","Adcock, T. A. A.","Obhrai, C.","Gudmestad, O. T.","Tarp-Johansen, Niels Jacob","Meyer, C. P.","Krokstad, J. R.","Suja-Thauvin, L.","Hanson, T. D."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-366367"],"event":{"end":"2016-01-22","place":"Trondheim, no","start":"2016-01-20","title":"13th Deep Sea Offshore Wind R&amp;D Conference","year":"2016"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Norway","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Equinor ASA","Statkraft AS","University of Oxford","University of Stavanger"],"keyword":["Extreme waves","Hydrodynamic loads","Numerical modelling","Offshore wind turbines","Physical model tests"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"GTS":["DI-GTS-ALL","DI-GTS-DHYI"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-ØR"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-GTS-DHYI","DI-PR-ØR","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"derisk accurate prediction of uls wave loads outlook and first results","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/127446530/1_s2.0_S1876610216308657_main.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-366367","identifier":[{"id":"84998694341","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-cefccb25-8b6d-4c83-a2f4-8a4fcba32829"],"keyword":["Extreme waves","Hydrodynamic loads","Numerical modelling","Offshore wind turbines","Physical model tests"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-6B598BF04CDD3A5E05A34ADC6A255890"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/127446530/1_s2.0_S1876610216308657_main.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Wind Energy","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Wind Energy, Fluid Mechanics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"dhi danish hydraulic institu